    "created_at": "2025-04-01T19:34:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-01T19:34:13Z",
    "body": "Note that you'd also want to add the `Signature-Input` header to the same list, as they're designed to work together in tandem.\n\nRFC9421 is in use for API protection but I haven't seen it as much browser-side yet. I would personally love to see native support added to `fetch()` calls (ie, pass in a key and signature parameters and it signs the message with a non-exported key for you).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
